## Files involved

| File | Purpose |
|---|---|
| frontend/Dockerfile | Builds Vite and packages output in Nginx. |
| frontend/nginx.conf | Serves React and proxies /api/ to the backend. |
| frontend/.dockerignore | Excludes dependencies, secrets, output, and logs. |
| frontend/package-lock.json | Provides the synchronized graph used by npm ci. |

## Security decisions

- Frontend .env files are excluded from the build context.
- No credentials, session secrets, email passwords, or GitHub tokens are documented.
- Razorpay remains disabled.
- The backend remains private on port 2987.
- Production authentication still requires HTTPS because secure cookies are enabled.

## Completion and next step

Step 4 is complete. Step 5 will add Docker Compose, a shared network, coordinated startup, restart behavior, health checks, and public exposure only through Nginx on port 80.
